Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.25,0:00:04.05,TL,,0,0,0,,年初 她止步布里斯班{\fs78}8{\fs68}强
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.05,0:00:06.61,TL,,0,0,0,,澳网决赛 决胜盘{\fs78}0{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}落后
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.61,0:00:10.06,TL,,0,0,0,,她却以{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}逆转 赢下冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.23,0:00:21.95,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Rybakina. It's Elena Rybakina who moves ahead in this final.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N莱巴金娜在决赛中取得领先
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.15,0:00:27.31,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}She gets the important break and leads 4-3. Final set.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N关键破发 决胜盘四比三领先
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.53,0:00:29.88,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And she has been so impressive{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她的表现一直如此出色
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.88,0:00:32.17,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}second half of last season,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N从上个赛季的后半程
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.17,0:00:35.88,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and now lifting the trophy{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N到如今举起冠军奖杯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.88,0:00:38.58,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}at the first major of this new season.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N在新赛季的首站大满贯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.78,0:00:41.91,TL,,0,0,0,,多哈止步{\fs78}8{\fs68}强 迪拜因病退赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.91,0:00:45.33,TL,,0,0,0,,来到印第安维尔斯 她又打进决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.28,0:00:49.65,TL,,0,0,0,,莱巴金娜握有冠军点 却没能拿下
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.65,0:00:51.52,TL,,0,0,0,,决胜盘抢七{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}8{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.52,0:00:53.50,TL,,0,0,0,,她输给萨巴伦卡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.69,0:01:04.11,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Third time is a charm for Aryna Sabalenka.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N第三次 萨巴伦卡终于做到了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.97,0:01:09.89,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}As revenge is served.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她完成了复仇
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.68,0:01:12.01,TL,,0,0,0,,迈阿密半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.01,0:01:14.44,TL,,0,0,0,,萨巴伦卡再次让她止步
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.44,0:01:15.94,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}4{\fs68}月的斯图加特
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.94,0:01:17.89,TL,,0,0,0,,她先挽救两个赛点过关
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.89,0:01:20.71,TL,,0,0,0,,最终在决赛击败穆霍娃
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.67,0:01:31.29,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It is a second Stuttgart title for Elena Rybakina.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N莱巴金娜第{\fs78}2{\fs68}次在斯图加特夺冠
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.71,0:01:36.95,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I mean, it's a very attractive tournament in every sense of the word.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这项赛事各方面都很有吸引力
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.38,0:01:39.12,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Overall, as I say,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N总的来说 正如我所说
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.28,0:01:41.75,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I think I'm on a good path right now,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我觉得自己走在正确的路上
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.75,0:01:44.08,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and we are doing a good job with the team,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我和团队的工作也做得很好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.12,0:01:47.02,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}so I'm just hoping not to stop{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N所以我希望继续前进
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.02,0:01:48.48,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}and do even better.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N表现得更好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.75,0:01:52.31,TL,,0,0,0,,马德里第四轮出局 罗马止步{\fs78}8{\fs68}强
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.31,0:01:54.32,TL,,0,0,0,,来到法网 她先赢一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.32,0:01:58.13,TL,,0,0,0,,却输掉决胜盘抢七 止步第二轮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.35,0:02:13.79,TL,,0,0,0,,草地赛季 女王杯打进{\fs78}8{\fs68}强
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.79,0:02:15.59,TL,,0,0,0,,柏林第二轮出局
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.59,0:02:19.56,TL,,0,0,0,,回到温网 她在第三轮输给梅尔滕斯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.24,0:02:29.74,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}The world number two is out.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N世界第二出局了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.96,0:02:35.28,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}A huge upset here on Number One Court.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N一号球场爆出大冷门
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.55,0:02:37.39,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}8{\fs68}月 多伦多
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.39,0:02:40.36,TL,,0,0,0,,莱巴金娜连续逆转大坂直美和高芙
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.36,0:02:42.72,TL,,0,0,0,,再次走进决赛 最后
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.72,0:02:44.79,TL,,0,0,0,,她输给斯瓦泰克
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.38,0:03:00.88,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Sensational Swiatek takes the title in Toronto.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N斯瓦泰克表现惊艳 拿下多伦多冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.55,0:03:05.07,TL,,0,0,0,,辛辛那提{\fs78}1{\fs68}/{\fs78}4{\fs68}决赛 两人又相遇
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.07,0:03:08.72,TL,,0,0,0,,首盘{\fs78}1{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68} 莱巴金娜因伤退赛
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.55,0:03:12.35,TL,,0,0,0,,到了纽约 对郑钦文 对高芙
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.35,0:03:14.65,TL,,0,0,0,,她都是先丢一盘后逆转
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.65,0:03:17.40,TL,,0,0,0,,决赛 又是萨巴伦卡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.05,0:03:20.21,TL,,0,0,0,,今年第三次在决赛相遇
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.21,0:03:22.10,TL,,0,0,0,,莱巴金娜用{\fs78}3{\fs68}盘胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.10,0:03:24.84,TL,,0,0,0,,拿下本赛季第二座大满贯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.46,0:03:40.02,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Five-two.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N五比二
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.70,0:03:47.80,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}What a year to finish with two Grand Slam trophies.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这一年 以两座大满贯奖杯收尾
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.39,0:03:50.48,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It feels amazing.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N感觉太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.65,0:03:54.02,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}It's still so difficult to process what happened.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我现在还是很难消化这一切
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.31,0:03:58.85,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Too many achievements these few weeks.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这几周取得的成就太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.98,0:04:00.20,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}I'm super happy.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N我特别开心
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.30,0:04:02.82,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Very proud of all the work.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N也为付出的所有努力感到自豪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.00,0:04:06.68,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}9{\fs68}月{\fs78}14{\fs68}日 {\fs78}WTA{\fs68}正式确认 莱巴金娜
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.68,0:04:10.03,TL,,0,0,0,,是本届年终的首位单打入围者
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.00,0:04:15.25,TL,,0,0,0,,也是这一天 她正式登上世界第{\fs78}1{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.25,0:04:18.17,TL,,0,0,0,,但这个赛季 还没有结束
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.00,0:04:21.21,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}9{\fs68}月{\fs78}18{\fs68}日 她因医疗原因
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.21,0:04:23.44,TL,,0,0,0,,退出金杯总决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.50,0:04:26.56,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}10{\fs68}月{\fs78}3{\fs68}日 北京
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.56,0:04:29.27,TL,,0,0,0,,她以世界第{\fs78}1{\fs68}身份出战的首场比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.27,0:04:31.46,TL,,0,0,0,,对手是恰拉耶娃
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.16,0:04:43.48,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And Alina Charaeva manufactures a lifelong dream in real time.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N恰拉耶娃此刻实现毕生梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.00,0:04:48.06,TL,,0,0,88,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Achieves a majestic, career-defining victory in Beijing.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N她在北京赢下生涯标志性胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.25,0:04:50.84,TL,,0,0,0,,先赢一盘 再丢两盘
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.84,0:04:54.63,TL,,0,0,0,,中网第二轮 成了她这一站的终点
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.55,0:04:58.41,TL,,0,0,0,,第二天 她又因伤退出武汉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.41,0:04:59.63,TL,,0,0,0,,两座大满贯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.63,0:05:02.53,TL,,0,0,0,,也不能替她免去恢复的时间
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.55,0:05:05.91,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}10{\fs68}月 她回到宁波
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.91,0:05:06.98,TL,,0,0,0,,复出首战
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.98,0:05:09.81,TL,,0,0,0,,对手是波利娜 库德梅托娃
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.81,0:05:11.88,TL,,0,0,0,,比赛仍待开打
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.55,0:05:15.85,TL,,0,0,0,,{\fs78}7502{\fs68}分 门票早已在手
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.85,0:05:17.08,TL,,0,0,0,,年终总决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.08,0:05:19.89,TL,,0,0,0,,你最期待她怎样的表现？
